          "status": "not_applicable",
          "reason": "The assertion types the explicit polynomial T_n as a Borel symmetric-matrix statistic and covariance-target estimator. Proof1.1 establishes continuity/measurability and2.1 applies the estimator definition; it asserts neither a converse measurability criterion nor unbiasedness/consistency. The forward boundary would require a separate asserted biconditional, which this specific claim does not contain."
        },
        {
