          "reason": "The assertion types the explicit polynomial T_n as a Borel symmetric-matrix statistic and covariance-target estimator. Proof1.1 establishes continuity/measurability and2.1 applies the estimator definition; it asserts neither a converse measurability criterion nor unbiasedness/consistency. The reverse boundary would infer these hypotheses or this construction from the conclusion, an implication this specific item does not assert."
        }
